---------------------------

data/example_models.rda, component example_models$energyRt

  The GAMS model source of energyRt (gams/energyRt.gms), as a character
  vector, and the multimod model parsed from it with data from an
  interpolated energyRt scenario (TOPIA kit, R7 regions).

