Content read by the documentation, not bundled
----------------------------------------------

The website article "Two models from the field" and the test
tests/testthat/test-read-gmpl.R read a published MathProg model from a local
clone of its repository, located by the environment variable
MULTIMOD_OSEMOSYS_DIR. None of that model is included in the package.

